! Radial cascade at 0.47 deg, level 3 TEST without the cap (2026-11-25): 168
! cells (top at 0.998 R, -1.5 Mm), plain conductor top (no b_top_beq). The
! clean version of casc047_l3test: does the near-top field level off near B_eq
! once the Lorentz force acts in full?
! - Import from casc047_l2test's export (t = 1 yr + 10 d) as casc047_l3test:
!   cells 1-140 (all variables) from the export, 141-168 from the init file at
!   rest with B = 0; b_seed 'none'. 2 days (to t = 1 yr + 12 d).
! - NO Alfven cap (va_max = 0, the default). casc047_l3test had va_max 10 km/s
!   from mhd5: the cap acted in up to 8e-4 of the cells (peak v_A 31-36 km/s,
!   f ~0.1, 15-20 kG top tubes, rho1/rho0 -0.4) and the run hit NaN at day
!   11.48 in the top cell (lat -35, lon -171). Its dt (2.55 s) was set by the
!   capped v_A (~10 km/s) in the top two cells, where the radial Alfven speed
!   stays in the CFL (outside the semi-implicit range).
! - dt: uncapped v_A enters the CFL at the top. If the tubes again reach v_A
!   ~35 km/s, dt ~1 s (cfl 0.5, dr 92 km); if the full Lorentz force stops them
!   near v_A ~ c_s, dt ~2 s. l3test cost ~8.8 SU per model day at 2.55 s, so
!   2 days ~18-45 SU, ~2-5 h. The job's time limit stops the run cleanly with a
!   restart (wall_time_max from the job script); restart every day.
! - Needs casc047_l2test's state_export_r*.bin (written at its end).
!   sbatch -N 6 --ntasks-per-node 96 -t 05:00:00 tools/job.stampede3_seq runs/casc047_l3nocap.nml
&cz3d
  import_dir = '/scratch/09595/xianyu2023/CZTR_3D_out/casc047_l2test'
  grid_file = 'data/grid_atm20.dat', init_file = 'data/init_wind20_dip_m600.dat', n_r_cells = 168
  table_file = 'data/eos_table_wind.bin'
  out_dir = '/scratch/09595/xianyu2023/CZTR_3D_out/casc047_l3nocap'
  wall_top = 'face'
  top_energy = 'cooling', cool_width_hp = 1.0, grey_top_km = 1000.0
  use_convection = .false.
  rsst_depth_km = 500.0, rsst_q = -0.5, rsst_form = 'hotta2012'
  diffusion_heating = .true.
  ds1_random = 1.0
  yy_margin = 0, n_theta = 48, n_phi = 144, nb_theta = 8, nb_phi = 24, refine_h = 2, nb_r = 28
  use_atmosphere = .false.
  use_B = .true., b_seed = 'none', b_bc_bottom = 'conductor', b_bc_top = 'conductor'
  si_radial = .true., b_diff_form = 'resistive', b_eta_dr = 1.0
  omega_rot = 2.6e-6, lz_correct_steps = 20
  dt1 = 0.0, mr_levels = 0
  t_end = 3.25968e7, n_step_max = 100000000, dt_max = 1.0e4
  n_log = 100, dt_prof = 0.0, prof_every = 300, plot_dt = 0.0, restart_dt = 86400.0
  dump_shells = 112, 140, 141, 154, 162, 168
  wall_time_margin = 1800.0
  export_state = .true.
/
